        "boarding_home_label": "omawild.com",
        "hero_eyebrow": "THE EXPEDITION PLAN",
        "hero_heading": "Stay 100% delusional until it works, because there is no Plan B for Planet Earth.",
        "hero_body": "Omawild is a conservation-led food brand, starting with specialty coffee. We're on a mission to turn everything we consume into a vehicle that funds ecological regeneration and conservation efforts across the world, because regenerative farming is the most direct way to protect natural ecosystems. Think of Omawild as the nature fund that everyone can easily invest in.",
        "hero_image_ph": "Drop hero photo: the crew outside, cups up",
        "hero_sticker": "COFFEE IS THE\nGATEWAY DRUG\nTO NATURE",
        "story_eyebrow": "HOW WE STARTED",
        "story_heading": "Our story began in Bali.",
        "story_body": "It started during an expedition across Bali, in a season of change when little made sense except for the conservation work that kept calling us back to Indonesia.",
        "mission_eyebrow": "OUR MISSION",
        "mission_heading": "Food is conservation work",
        "mission_pull": "Food is fundamental to our survival. We depend on it daily, but most of our food is produced in ways that harm our planet, and ourselves.",
        "mission_body": "Food grown regeneratively heals. It actively restores and gives back, completing the circle of life. Regenerative agriculture is conservation on the ground, so we only buy from producers doing it.",
        "ors_eyebrow": "SOURCING CRITERIA",
        "ors_heading": "Regenerative producers have to pass the Omawild Regenerative Standard (ORS)",
        "ors_body": "Skip the middleman. We work directly with each producer so we can exchange ideas, share what we learn, and thrive together.",
        "scale_eyebrow": "A NOTE ON SCALE",
        "scale_body": "Fully regenerative crops are rare, and holding every product to our four ORS would make it very hard to grow. As we scale, we will consider partnering from farmers who are willing to transition to regenerative agriculture, and we support them through it. By then, products will carry one of two labels for full customer transparency.",
        "legend_1_label": "REGENERATIVE",
        "legend_1_body": "Passes all four criteria.",
        "legend_2_label": "IN TRANSITION",
        "legend_2_body": "Organic farmers committed to moving towards regenerative agriculture with an agreed plan we can also help support.",
        "legend_3_label": "ORGANIC",
        "legend_3_body": "Organic farmers who grow without synthetic fertilisers, pesticides or herbicides.",
        "pantry_eyebrow": "THE OUTDOOR PANTRY",
        "pantry_heading": "Everything you'd find inside your backpack to keep the adventure going.",
        "pantry_body": "Our product roadmap at Omawild is built around a simple philosophy of clean and delicious food that keeps you energised throughout your adventures. Because more time spent outside means more connection to nature, and to the magic of being alive. And the more we love a place, the more we will want to protect it.",
        "goals_eyebrow": "MILESTONES",
        "goals_heading": "Shoot for the moon. Land among the stars.",
        "goals_body": "We're here for the journey, but also the destination.",
